{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/351849-changeling-in-webcomics-other-media","id":351849,"title":"Changeling in Webcomics & other Media","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-27T11:20:25-08:00","id":351849,"title":"Changeling in Webcomics & other Media","content":"So, right now Weregeek is doing a C:tL LARP storyline. It starts <a href=\"http://www.weregeek.com/2014/11/10/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and they're currently just doing character generation, but it's got some fun stuff in it.<br /> <br /> It made me wonder if any other webcomics were doing things about Changeling or set in the Changeling setting. Also, are there any other pieces of media that you go to for Changeling resources?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-27T18:16:46-08:00","id":352143,"title":"","content":"My suggestion? A lot of 80s fantasy movies would get you going. Legend, Labyrinth, Dark Crystal, Never Ending Story, just to name a few.<br /> <br /> But for recent media. I could recommend a great animated mini-series called. &quot;Over the Garden Wall&quot; It really hits on &quot;Lost in the Hedge&quot; theme if not Changeling altogether.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>&quot;I am a daydreamer and a Night thinker.&quot;~</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1820-nightout","name":"Nightout","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1820_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-27T18:28:13-08:00","id":352152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nightout</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/351849-changeling-in-webcomics-other-media?p=352143#post352143\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My suggestion? A lot of 80s fantasy movies would get you going. Legend, Labyrinth, Dark Crystal, Never Ending Story, just to name a few.<br /> <br /> But for recent media. I could recommend a great animated mini-series called. &amp;quot;Over the Garden Wall&amp;quot; It really hits on &amp;quot;Lost in the Hedge&amp;quot; theme if not Changeling altogether.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agree with the last one. The Beast would make a lovely Keeper.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-27T18:42:44-08:00","id":352168,"title":"","content":"You should check out an animated movie called &quot;Spirited Away&quot;, directed by the excellent Hayao Miyazaki. It is a great source of aesthetic and thematic inspiration for Changeling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-27T23:46:12-08:00","id":352392,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/351849-changeling-in-webcomics-other-media?p=352152#post352152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Agree with the last one. The Beast would make a lovely Keeper.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm glad someone noticed that too. The Woodsman would certainly be a Contracted Mortal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>&quot;I am a daydreamer and a Night thinker.&quot;~</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1820-nightout","name":"Nightout","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1820_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T02:43:24-08:00","id":352510,"tit